# The build context is the repository root; BuildKit reads this file because it sits beside
# ctde_arena/Dockerfile. Only the shared engine (src/) and this tree are needed.
# Keep the image context to code and pinned requirements. data/ and results/ are the evidence base and
# are mounted at run time (README "Docker"), not baked into an image that would then age differently.
*
!src
!ctde_arena
ctde_arena/.venv
ctde_arena/.venv-check
ctde_arena/.venv.broken_old
ctde_arena/data
ctde_arena/results
ctde_arena/mlruns
ctde_arena/exports
ctde_arena/docs_assets_tmp
ctde_arena/__pycache__
ctde_arena/.pytest_cache
ctde_arena/.coverage
ctde_arena/htmlcov
ctde_arena/tests
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/__pycache__
